  "prefLabel": "Puc 507.01 F-3 Statement of Pro Forma Income Statement at Present and Proposed Rates for Year Ended",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 507.01 F-3 Statement of Pro Forma Income Statement at Present and Proposed Rates for Year Ended.\n\n(a) Each utility which requests a rate increase shall file Form F-3, available at www.puc.nh.gov, with the commission and the department.\n\n(b) The utility shall include on the form the name of the utility filing the report.\n\n(c) Utilities shall include on Form F-3 a breakdown of operating revenues and expenses for:\n\n(1) Actual year ended and preceding 2 years;\n\n(2) Adjustments and pro forma at present rates;\n\n(3) Adjustments and pro forma at proposed rates with additional requirements; and\n\n(4) Total requirements.\n\n(d) Utilities shall include on Form F-3 a calculation of rate base and calculation of rate of return.\n\n(e) Each utility requesting a rate increase shall also comply with the requirements of Puc 1600, tariffs and special contracts.\n\n(f) Form F-3 shall be submitted with the signature, full name, and title of the utility employee who supervised the preparation of the report, and date of signature.\n\nSource. #13794, eff 10-25-23; ss by #14462, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES 1-2-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc500.html"
